Z||000000||Oreif||08-28-2001||12:07 PM||||Hey everyone, Just 5 minutes ago UPS delivered a set of side scoops that I bought from 007DOUG. These are EXCELLENT! I have seen many other types from other companies and these blow them away in quality! When Doug says "ready to paint" that is exactly what you get. Even with just the primer finish they look as smooth as glass. No ripples, pits, seams, or mold lines. Others I have seen usually required at <I>LEAST</I> 10 hours of work <I>EACH</I> prior to painting. These do not and the price is unbeatable!<BR>Sage (who actually makes them) does an Excellent job. The entire panel is even and lines up perfectly. <BR>I'm sending mine to the paint shop on Friday. It's just a shame I won't have time to install them before the NIFE Fierorama on the 9th. As soon as I get them on I will take some pics and post them.<P>I highly recommend that if you want the Pontiac style scoops, Get these. You won't find a better set with the high quality these have!<P>Click this link: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/004338.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/004338.html</A> <P>and order your set today!!!!<P><BR>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">      <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 08-28-2001).]||||reg||4
