Z||000003||Sage||08-28-2001||10:02 PM||||Oreif:<P>Thanks for the great review.  Am really glad you like the scoops.  Was a little concerned about their getting there in one piece!  Glad to they made it. Hopefully, this will only be the first of several mods to be made for the Fiero.  Am working toward being able to do fiberglass and nothing else, but right now, I am having to fit it in as I have time.  Thanks again for the kind words and for taking a chance on us!  (If you know Doug, tho, it's no risk to order ANYTHING from him!  He delivers what he advertises!)  We have been getting orders steadily since he introduced the scoops on his site.  I am having a rough time keeping up!  That's the way we like it tho, keep 'em coming!<P>Chadman, thank you too for the verification of quality.  We aim to please.<P>Thanks and have a good one!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR>Almost forgot!  Pics PLEASE whenever you have them done and installed!  I don't know how you could improve the appearance of your car, as it looks pretty much like a show stopper as is, but would like to see how they turned out on it.  Thanks...Cya!<p>[This message has been edited by Sage (edited 08-28-2001).]||||reg||1
